<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Colourspray</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 75)
Mana: 34
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast colourspray &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast colourspray</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The third of the colour spells, stronger than colourbeam: a spray of 
blinding colours tears at the target's mind. The better your power and mind 
sphere, the more it hurts. It does a little better against clothes than 
against plate, and a shield takes some of it, but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
